message: "If you use any workflow in this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "OSDF Examples: Reference Computational Workflows for Earth System Data Streaming via PelicanFS"
abstract: >-
  A collection of Jupyter notebook workflows that stream Earth System Science
  data from Open Science Data Federation (OSDF) origins using PelicanFS, and
  run analysis on a variety of HPC and cloud platforms (NCAR Casper, TACC
  Stampede3, Indiana Jetstream2, OSPool, laptop). Notebooks demonstrate
  bias correction, climatology, equilibrium climate sensitivity, machine
  learning, and benchmarking against datasets including CESM2 LENS, ERA5,
  CMIP6, NA-CORDEX, CONUS404, JRA-3Q, DART, HRRR, HadISST, NOAA SONAR, and
  Sentinel-2.
type: software
